Dear Lisa van Wyk,

Thank you for being a valued customer of Umhlanga Packaging. Here is our monthly newsletter for November 2026 edition.

In product news this month we have added extra strong double wall cartons in three new sizes suitable for workshop parts and finished panels. We also have restocked kraft paper rolls and recyclable void fill made from offcuts. Ask our team for samples on your next order.

Our seasonal tip as we head towards summer is to store boxes and paper away from direct sun and damp floors to keep them crisp and easy to handle. Rotate older stock to the front so nothing sits too long in the heat.

If you no longer wish to receive this newsletter, please reply to this email with Unsubscribe as the subject and we will remove you promptly.

